<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="zh-Hant"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="29572738"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1716153291"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Play我呸"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="蔡依林"/><amll:meta key="album" value="呸"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:13.424"><div begin="00:19.381" end="03:07.735"><p begin="00:19.381" end="00:23.484" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">怎麼回事 荷爾蒙驅使<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怎么回事 荷尔蒙驱使</span></p><p begin="00:23.736" end="00:27.869" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">離開格子 告別虛擬城池<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离开格子 告别虚拟城池</span></p><p begin="00:28.083" end="00:32.079" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">誰的身體 都有些故事<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁的身体 都有些故事</span></p><p begin="00:32.482" end="00:36.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">得到鑰匙 就大方點 大膽點試<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">得到钥匙 就大方点 大胆点试</span></p><p begin="00:36.290" end="00:38.977" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">照鏡子就應該笑<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照镜子就应该笑</span></p><p begin="00:39.017" end="00:41.078" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">旁若無人也好<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">旁若无人也好</span></p><p begin="00:41.447" end="00:45.007" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">我跟自己最要好<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我跟自己最要好</span></p><p begin="00:45.027" end="00:47.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">要跨出去才王道<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要跨出去才王道</span></p><p begin="00:47.750" end="00:49.799" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">感覺必須良好<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉必须良好</span></p><p begin="00:50.139" end="00:54.073" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">誰分別誰 不重要<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁分别谁 不重要</span></p><p begin="00:54.319" end="00:58.608" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic</span></p><p begin="01:03.039" end="01:07.394" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic</span></p><p begin="01:20.419" end="01:24.642" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">好自為之 不想被指使<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好自为之 不想被指使</span></p><p begin="01:24.809" end="01:29.109" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">問潛意識 你另一個樣子<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">问潜意识 你另一个样子</span></p><p begin="01:29.137" end="01:33.244" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">各位觀眾 都無權限制<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">各位观众 都无权限制</span></p><p begin="01:33.542" end="01:37.428" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">我自戀我 魔鬼天使 哪種模式<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我自恋我 魔鬼天使 哪种模式</span></p><p begin="01:37.428" end="01:40.028" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">照鏡子就應該笑<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照镜子就应该笑</span></p><p begin="01:40.133" end="01:42.232" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">旁若無人也好<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">旁若无人也好</span></p><p begin="01:42.580" end="01:46.129" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">我跟自己最要好<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我跟自己最要好</span></p><p begin="01:46.139" end="01:48.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">要跨出去才王道<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要跨出去才王道</span></p><p begin="01:48.837" end="01:50.839" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">感覺必須良好<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉必须良好</span></p><p begin="01:51.235" end="01:55.214" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">誰分別誰 不重要<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁分别谁 不重要</span></p><p begin="01:55.408" end="01:59.749" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic</span></p><p begin="02:04.119" end="02:08.474" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic</span></p><p begin="02:12.853" end="02:14.854" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">會疼會癢會大笑<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会疼会痒会大笑</span></p><p begin="02:15.317" end="02:16.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">何必掩飾<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">何必掩饰</span></p><p begin="02:17.211" end="02:19.287" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">沒什麼不該固執<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没什么不该固执</span></p><p begin="02:19.409" end="02:21.282" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">自我中心又怎樣<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自我中心又怎样</span></p><p begin="02:21.594" end="02:23.443" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">你我他不同視角<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我他不同视角</span></p><p begin="02:24.035" end="02:25.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">兌現真實<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">兑现真实</span></p><p begin="02:26.225" end="02:27.518" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">樂意宣誓<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">乐意宣誓</span></p><p begin="02:27.601" end="02:30.286" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">我就是最美好的構造<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是最美好的构造</span></p><p begin="02:30.296" end="02:34.656" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic</span></p><p begin="02:39.001" end="02:43.372" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic</span></p><p begin="02:47.735" end="02:52.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic</span></p><p begin="02:56.507" end="03:00.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Ego, ego-holic, ego, ego-holic</span></p><p begin="03:05.205" end="03:07.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Ego, ego-holic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Ego, ego-holic</span></p></div></body></tt>